# Authored fresh for greenmachine-next (GMN-000A). Never reintroduce `* text=auto`:
# on a default Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) it rewrites text files to CRLF,
# so a clone no longer reproduces the committed bytes. This project ships
# digest-pinned evidence; checkout bytes must equal committed bytes on every platform.

# Default: every file is text, committed and checked out with LF.
* text eol=lf

# Binary files: exempt from all text conversion.
*.png -text
*.jpg -text
*.jpeg -text
*.gif -text
*.ico -text
*.pdf -text
*.zip -text
*.gz -text
*.tar -text
*.whl -text
*.parquet -text
*.xlsx -text
*.db -text
*.sqlite -text
*.sqlite3 -text
*.woff -text
*.woff2 -text

# Evidence and data payloads are digest-pinned: byte-exact, never normalized,
# even though many are text formats (JSON, CSV, Markdown).
evidence/** -text
data/** -text
